<title>JAPAN: Toshiba Ceramics - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Toshiba Ceramics - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 46.69		vs	   38.25</p>
<p> Operating	    5.69		vs	    3.42</p>
<p> Current		5.31		vs	    2.84</p>
<p> Net		    2.71		vs	    2.82</p>
<p> EPS		   17.89 yen	  vs	   18.65 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    152 million	  vs	 151 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Toshiba Ceramics Co Ltd is a quartz glass producer affiliated with Toshiba Corp.</p>
